  {"g3:0821c07f", "You know, if I win at a BEAUTY\\nCONTEST, sure it makes me\\n\\nhappy. More than usual, anyway.", "Eu acho que qualquer um quer ganhar\\num CONCURSO na CATEGORIA\\n\\nBELEZA. NÃo estou certa?"},
  {"g3:0821c0d8", "Wahahahah!\\n\\nWill you take a gander at all those\\npretty POKéMON!\\n\\nI just love this sort of glitz!", "Ahahahahaha!\\n\\nVeja bem todos esse lindos POKéMON!   \\nSÃo tÃo bonitos que até te encanta!"},
  {"g3:0821c137", "You can't always win on just beauty\\nalone.\\n\\nYou have to groom your POKéMON so\\nit's nice and glossy like mine.", "A beleza natural nÃo é suficiente.\\n\\nVocê tem que escovar o seu POKéMON\\npara ficar fascinante igual ao meu."},
  {"g3:0821c1a4", "MC: Uh-oh! Hello!\\nWe're in the middle of a CONTEST!\\n\\nPlease enter at our registration\\ncounter and come out, okay?", "MC: Uh-oh! Olá!\\nEstamos no meio de um CONCURSO!\\n\\nPor favor, faça seu registro lá fora no\\nbalcÃo da recepçÃo, ok."},
  {"g3:0821c215", "JUDGE: Oh, such charming and cute\\nappeals!\\n\\nOh, my goodness! What a perfectly\\nadorable WATER SPORT appeal!", "JUIZ: Nunca vi apelos tÃo\\nencantadores.\\n\\nPor exemplo, esse ESPORTE ÁGUA é\\nadorável merece muitos pontos."},
  {"g3:0821c27f", "Oh, no... My sweet AZURILL was\\ndistracted by another POKéMON.", "NÃoooo... Minha doce AZURILL foi\\ndistraÍda por outro POKéMON."},
  {"g3:0821c2bb", "My POKéMON has never won in a battle,\\nbut put it in a CONTEST and look out!", "Meu POKéMON nunca ganhou na batalha,\\nmas veja como ganha fácil o CONCURSO!"},
  {"g3:0821c307", "My POKéMON's PETAL DANCE is a marvel\\nof elegance.\\n\\nI won't let anyone disturb its\\nperformance.", "DANÇA PÉTALA do meu POKéMON\\ntem muita elegância.\\n\\nNÃo deixarei que nada perturbe\\nsua atuaçÃo."},
  {"g3:0821c365", "Everyone's POKéMON are very cute.\\n\\nHowever, if my POKéMON were to make\\na cute appeal...\\n\\nI'm sure that it would be so much \\ncuter than the others.", "Todo mundo pensa que seus POKéMON\\ntem mais graça de todos.\\n\\nNo entanto, quando o meu POKéMON\\nfaz um apelo CHARMOSO...\\n\\nCertamente ganha aplausos."},
  {"g3:0821c3f4", "My child is in this CONTEST.", "Meu filho está no CONCURSO."},
  {"g3:0821c411", "Come on, dear. Go for it!\\nYour POKéMON is the best!", "Meu querido. Vá em frente!\\nSeu POKéMON é o melhor!"},
  {"g3:0821c445", "I think that girl over there is\\nthe cutest of the lot.\\n\\nWhat's that? They're judging\\nPOKéMON by their looks?", "Eu acho que a menina ali é\\na mais charmosa aqui.\\n\\nO que? Eles estÃo julgando POKéMON\\ne nÃo seus TREINADORES?"},
  {"g3:0821c4b1", "Ohh, seeing all these cute POKéMON,\\nthey make we want to get my own!\\n\\nI'm going to go catch some!", "Oooooh, vendo todos estes POKéMON tÃo,\\ncharmosos, eu quero é ter um...\\n\\nEu vou é capturar uns 4!"},
  {"g3:0821c512", "BEAUTY CONTEST STAGE\\nBE ALLURED BY BEAUTIFUL POKéMON!", "CATEGORIA BELEZA      \\nSEDUZA-SE COM POKéMON BONITOS!"},
  {"g3:0821c548", "CUTENESS CONTEST STAGE\\nBE CHARMED BY CUTE POKéMON!", "CATEGORIA GRAÇA  \\nENCANTE-SE COM POKéMON CHARMOSO!"},
  {"g3:0821c57b", "SMARTNESS CONTEST STAGE\\nBE IMPRESSED BY SMART POKéMON!", "CATEGORIA ESPERTO \\nIMPRESSIONE-SE COM POKéMON ESPERTO!"},
  {"g3:0821c61e", "I wonder how many kinds of POKéMON\\nthere are in the world.\\n\\nIt'd be great to cross seas and\\ntrade POKéMON with people far away.", "Eu me pergunto quantos tipos de POKéMON\\nexistem no mundo.\\n\\nSeria ótimo atravessar mares e trocar\\nPOKéMON com pessoas distantes."},
  {"g3:0821c69d", "I've been hearing about some rotten\\nscoundrels who steal POKéMON and rip\\n\\noff METEORITES.", "Eu tenho ouvido algo sobre os canalhas\\nladrÃo que roubam POKéMON e METEORITOS."},
  {"g3:0821c6f6", "Those rotten scoundrels who steal\\nPOKéMON and rip off METEORITES...\\n\\nI haven't seen them around recently.", "Aqueles canalhas podres que roubam\\nPOKéMON e METEORITOS...\\n\\nEu nÃo os vejo mais ao redor recentemente."},
  {"g3:0821cf00", "Oh, wow!\\nIt's {01}!", "Oh, uau!\\nÉ {01}!"},
  {"g3:0821cf12", "I've heard the news!\\nYou're really strong, aren't you?\\n\\nWe always argue about who is the\\nstrongest of all TRAINERS here.\\n\\nSo when I heard about you, I decided\\nto be your fan!\\n\\nI hope you'll keep on battling other\\ntough TRAINERS.\\n\\nThat way, we'll be able to see more\\nof your hot, hot battles.\\n\\nThat will make the others here see\\nexactly how great you are.\\n\\nRemember, I'm cheering for you,\\n{01}!", "Eu ouvi a notÍcia!\\nVocê é muito forte, verdade?\\n\\nAqui sempre estamos discutimos\\nsobre quem é o mais forte.\\n\\nEntÃo quando ouvi sobre você\\ndecidi ser teu fÃ número um.\\n\\nEspero que continue lutando\\ncontra TREINADORES duröes.\\n\\nAssim podemos seguir disfrutando\\nde suas emocionantes batalhas.\\n\\nE todo mundo se dará conta\\nde como você é grande.\\n\\nLembre-se que eu sempre estarei\\nte apoiando, {01}!"},
  {"g3:0821d094", "Yo, {01}!\\nYou're the one we want to win!", "Ei, {01}!\\nVamos sempre torcer por você!"},
  {"g3:0821d0bb", "The others, they don't know that\\nyou're the best of the best!\\n\\nIsn't that right, {01}?\\nShow them you've got guts!", "The others, they don't know that\\nyou're the best of the best!\\n\\nIsn't that right, {01}?\\nShow them you've got guts!"},
  {"g3:0821d12a", "I hate to say this, but the TRAINER\\neverybody's talking about is\\n\\n{02}, no question about it!\\n\\nThat TRAINER's power...\\nIt's out of the ordinary.", "I hate to say this, but the TRAINER\\neverybody's talking about is\\n\\n{02}, no question about it!\\n\\nThat TRAINER's power...\\nIt's out of the ordinary."},
  {"g3:0821d1b5", "Darn it... I've been telling people\\nthat {02} is the best now...\\n\\nBut no one wants to listen...", "Darn it... I've been telling people\\nthat {02} is the best now...\\n\\nBut no one wants to listen..."},
  {"g3:0821d20c", "I've been hearing things about\\na tough new TRAINER.\\n\\nThis TRAINER's supposed to be beating\\nGYM LEADERS, even.\\n\\nDo you know anything about this\\nnew TRAINER?", "Eu ouvi algo de um novo\\nTREINADOR muito forte...\\n\\nEste TREINADOR é suposto de\\nderrotar LÍDERES dos GINÁSIOS.\\n\\nVocê sabe algo sobre esse\\nnovo TREINADOR?"},
  {"g3:0821d2a6", "Oh!\\n{01}!\\n\\nGo for it!\\nI'm pulling for you!", "Oh, {01}!\\n\\nMuito bem!\\nSei que pode ganhar!"},
  {"g3:0821d2ce", "Sigh...\\nBRAWLY...\\n\\nOh, no! Wait!\\nThat's not right! No, no, no!\\n\\nI'm your fan through and through!\\n\\nSo make me proud!\\nGo for it!", "Sigh...\\nBRAWLY...\\n\\nOh, no! Wait!\\nThat's not right! No, no, no!\\n\\nI'm your fan through and through!\\n\\nSo make me proud!\\nGo for it!"},
  {"g3:0821d347", "I can't help it, I can only get to\\nlike BRAWLY...", "I can't help it, I can only get to\\nlike BRAWLY..."},
  {"g3:0821d377", "Nobody understands the charm of\\nBRAWLY...\\n\\nI don't care!\\n\\nEven if I'm the only one, I'm going\\nto keep cheering for BRAWLY!", "Nobody understands the charm of\\nBRAWLY...\\n\\nI don't care!\\n\\nEven if I'm the only one, I'm going\\nto keep cheering for BRAWLY!"},
  {"g3:0821d3ee", "Whatever anyone says, my favorite\\nTRAINER is DEWFORD's GYM LEADER\\n\\nBRAWLY!", "Podem falar, mas meu TREINADOR favorito\\né o LÍDER de DEWFORD BRAWLY!"},
  {"g3:0821d438", "You've surpassed your own father in\\nevery regard!\\n\\nI'm telling you, so there's no question\\nabout it at all!", "You've surpassed your own father in\\nevery regard!\\n\\nI'm telling you, so there's no question\\nabout it at all!"},
  {"g3:0821d4a3", "Even when things turned bleak,\\nyour father never gave up.\\n\\nThis I know to be true.\\n\\nYou never give up even if you lose!\\nSo keep on battling!", "Even when things turned bleak,\\nyour father never gave up.\\n\\nThis I know to be true.\\n\\nYou never give up even if you lose!\\nSo keep on battling!"},
  {"g3:0821d52e", "NORMAN battled with more power,\\ncharisma, and showmanship than you.\\n\\nEven though people may say that\\nyou're strong...\\n\\nYou've still got a long way to go\\ncompared to your father.", "NORMAN lutou com mais força,\\npersonalidade e estilo do que você.\\n\\nMuitos dizem que você é forte...,\\n\\nmas ainda acho que te falta muito o\\nque aprender para ser como seu pai."},
  {"g3:0821d5dc", "You're beginning to get the same\\nair of awe NORMAN exudes.\\n\\nBut there's something conclusively\\ndifferent between you and NORMAN.\\n\\nI can't tell you what that is.\\nYou'll have to find it yourself.", "You're beginning to get the same\\nair of awe NORMAN exudes.\\n\\nBut there's something conclusively\\ndifferent between you and NORMAN.\\n\\nI can't tell you what that is.\\nYou'll have to find it yourself."},
  {"g3:0821d69c", "Everyone here, we're all huge fans\\nof POKéMON battles.\\n\\nWe discuss who we consider to be\\nthe strongest of all TRAINERS.\\n\\nIf you were to become famous,\\nwe might even become your fans!", "Todos que estÃo aqui somos grandes\\nfÃs de batalhas POKéMON.\\n\\nSempre estamos discutindo quem\\né o melhor TREINADOR de todos.\\n\\nSe algum dia alcançar a fama,\\npodemos até ser teus fÃs!"},
  {"g3:0821d751", "Oh, woweee! It's {01}!\\nFor real, too!\\n\\nPlease, shake my hand, shake my hand!", "Oh, céus! É {01}!\\nEm carne e osso!\\n\\nPor favor, me dê a mÃo!\\nE um autografo!"},
  {"g3:0821d79b", "I'll always cheer for you, {01}!\\nAlways, always!\\n\\nI don't want to see you lose ever,\\n{01}.\\n\\nBecause I know you're really,\\nreally strong, {01}!", "I'll always cheer for you, {01}!\\nAlways, always!\\n\\nI don't want to see you lose ever,\\n{01}.\\n\\nBecause I know you're really,\\nreally strong, {01}!"},
  {"g3:0821d822", "{02} is really cool...\\n\\nEveryone thinks so, right, right?", "{02} is really cool...\\n\\nEveryone thinks so, right, right?"},
  {"g3:0821d857", "{02} really is cool, don't\\nyou think so?\\n\\nEven if it's just me, I'm going to keep\\ncheering my favorite TRAINER.", "{02} really is cool, don't\\nyou think so?\\n\\nEven if it's just me, I'm going to keep\\ncheering my favorite TRAINER."},
  {"g3:0821d8c4", "My favorite TRAINER is...\\n\\nCool...\\n\\nStrong...\\n\\nAnd really nice...\\n\\nI wish there was a TRAINER like that...", "Meu TREINADOR favorito é...\\n\\nlegal...\\n\\nforte...\\n\\ne muito bom.\\n\\nSeria bom se existisse\\nTREINADOR assim..."},
  {"g3:0821d921", "Whoa! It's {01}!\\nWicked!\\n\\nWhen I grow up, I want to be strong\\nlike you, {01}!", "Whoa! It's {01}!\\nWicked!\\n\\nWhen I grow up, I want to be strong\\nlike you, {01}!"},
  {"g3:0821d96a", "Even if I'm the only one...\\n\\nYou'll always be the only one\\nI cheer for, {01}!\\n\\nBecause I believe in you, {01}!", "Even if I'm the only one...\\n\\nYou'll always be the only one\\nI cheer for, {01}!\\n\\nBecause I believe in you, {01}!"},
  {"g3:0821d9d1", "{02} is so wickedly cool...\\nI want to shake hands with my hero.", "{02} é tÃo legal...\\nQuem me dera cumprimentar meu herói."},
  {"g3:0821da0d", "Even if I'm the only one...\\n\\nI'm never going to stop being\\n{02}'s fan!\\n\\nBecause I've heard, {02}\\nnever loses!", "Even if I'm the only one...\\n\\nI'm never going to stop being\\n{02}'s fan!\\n\\nBecause I've heard, {02}\\nnever loses!"},
  {"g3:0821da73", "{01}!\\nYou are amazing after all!\\n\\nEver since I set eyes on you,\\nI knew that you were great.\\n\\nIt looks like my eyes didn't deceive me.", "{01}!\\nYou are amazing after all!\\n\\nEver since I set eyes on you,\\nI knew that you were great.\\n\\nIt looks like my eyes didn't deceive me."},
  {"g3:0821daf5", "Who cares about the others.\\nI'm in your corner!\\n\\nYou don't need to worry. Just get\\nout there and battle like always.", "Who cares about the others.\\nI'm in your corner!\\n\\nYou don't need to worry. Just get\\nout there and battle like always."},
  {"g3:0821db69", "You're a pretty decent TRAINER,\\nI think.\\n\\nBut I also think that {02}\\nis number one right now.\\n\\nThat's just my opinion.\\nDon't worry about it too much.", "Você é um TREINADOR\\ndecente, eu acho.\\n\\nMas também acho que nÃo há nada\\nmelhor que {02} agora.\\n\\nÉ só a minha opiniÃo.\\nNÃo se preocupe muito com isso."},
  {"g3:0821dbfb", "Wow, you really are strong.\\nMaybe even stronger than {02}.\\n\\nBut {02} needs me.\\n\\nIf I don't cheer for {02},\\nwho will?", "Wow, you really are strong.\\nMaybe even stronger than {02}.\\n\\nBut {02} needs me.\\n\\nIf I don't cheer for {02},\\nwho will?"},
  {"g3:0821dc68", "You've changed my mind!\\nYou are strong, aren't you?\\n\\nI'd like you to tell me how you managed\\nto get so strong!", "You've changed my mind!\\nYou are strong, aren't you?\\n\\nI'd like you to tell me how you managed\\nto get so strong!"},
  {"g3:0821dcd6", "The tougher the situation, the more\\nattractively you battle.\\n\\nI can't wait for your next battle!", "The tougher the situation, the more\\nattractively you battle.\\n\\nI can't wait for your next battle!"},
  {"g3:0821dd36", "Among the recently hot TRAINERS,\\n{02} is the standout.\\n\\nThat toughness, it's simply not normal.\\n\\nYou're doing okay, but you're not in\\nthe same class as {02}.", "Há muitos TREINADORES que estÃo\\nbem, mas {02} é o destaque.\\n\\nSua força é algo sobrenatural...\\n\\nVocê está indo bem, mas nÃo posso\\ncomparar você com {02}."},
  {"g3:0821ddce", "You are really popular...\\n\\nYou're strong, and you're caring to\\nPOKéMON. No one can knock you.\\n\\nBut, you know, I believe in {02}.\\n\\n{02} is definitely stronger!\\nI'm positive!", "You are really popular...\\n\\nYou're strong, and you're caring to\\nPOKéMON. No one can knock you.\\n\\nBut, you know, I believe in {02}.\\n\\n{02} is definitely stronger!\\nI'm positive!"},
  {"g3:0821de72", "You...\\n\\nImpressive!", "You...\\n\\nImpressive!"},
  {"g3:0821de83", "Your true worth, it is fine if only\\nI recognized it.\\n\\nThe others I doubt will understand\\nthe hidden power that beats within.", "Your true worth, it is fine if only\\nI recognized it.\\n\\nThe others I doubt will understand\\nthe hidden power that beats within."},
  {"g3:0821deff", "Yes, I see strength in your eyes.\\n\\nBut!\\n\\nYou still haven't realized your\\npotential.", "Sim, eu vejo força em seus olhos.\\n\\nMas...\\n\\nainda nÃo percebeu o\\nseu enorme potencial."},
  {"g3:0821df51", "It is true that you are tremendously\\npowerful.\\n\\nBut!\\nI can tell...\\n\\nThat strength cannot be considered\\ntrue strength yet!\\n\\nTrue strength is...!\\n... ...\\n\\nActually, I have no idea, either.", "It is true that you are tremendously\\npowerful.\\n\\nBut!\\nI can tell...\\n\\nThat strength cannot be considered\\ntrue strength yet!\\n\\nTrue strength is...!\\n... ...\\n\\nActually, I have no idea, either."},
  {"g3:0821e6f1", "I beg your pardon?\\nYou're looking for a ship?\\n\\nI'm sorry, the ferry service isn't\\navailable at present...", "Eu peço desculpas?\\nVocê está à procura de um navio?\\n\\nLamento, o serviço nÃo está\\ndisponÍvel no momento..."},
  {"g3:0821e758", "Hello, are you here for the ferry?\\nMay I see your TICKET?", "Olá, veio para conhecer o navio?\\nPosso ver seu TICKET?"},
  {"g3:0821e792", "{01} doesn't have the TICKET...\\n\\nI'm terribly sorry.\\n\\nYou must have a TICKET to board\\nthe ferry.", "{01} doesn't have the TICKET...\\n\\nI'm terribly sorry.\\n\\nYou must have a TICKET to board\\nthe ferry."},
  {"g3:0821e7ed", "{01} flashed the TICKET.\\n\\nPerfect! That's all you need!\\n\\nAnd where would you like to go?", "{01} mostrou o TICKET...\\n\\nPerfeito. Isso é tudo o que precisa.\\n\\nE onde gostaria de ir?"},
  {"g3:0821e842", "Please sail with us another time!", "Queira navegar conosco outra vez!"},
  {"g3:0821e864", "SLATEPORT CITY it is, then!", "EntÃo, ir para SLATEPORT é?"},
  {"g3:0821e880", "BATTLE FRONTIER it is, then!", "Ir para BATTLE FRONTIER, é?"},
  {"g3:0821e89d", "Please board the ferry and wait for\\ndeparture.", "Por favor, suba a bordo\\ne espere a partida."},
  {"g3:0821e8cc", "Then, where would you like to go?", "EntÃo, onde você gostaria de ir?"},
  {"g3:0821e8ee", "Until they finish making the ferry,\\nwe sailors have nothing to do...\\n\\nI wish they'd get a move on, the folks\\nat the SHIPYARD in SLATEPORT.", "Até que terminem de fazer esse navio,\\nnós, marinheiros nÃo fazemos nada...\\n\\nDeveria começar logo... Há engenheiro no\\nestaleiro em SLATEPORT?"},
  {"g3:0821e976", "The ferry S.S. TIDAL is finally in\\noperation.\\n\\nThe folks at the SHIPYARD in SLATEPORT\\nmust've worked extra hard.\\n\\nWell, it's my turn to get busy now!", "O navio S.S. TIDAL já está\\nem funcionamento.\\n\\nO pessoal do ESTALEIRO em SLATEPORT\\ndevem ter trabalhado como loucos.\\n\\nE agora chegou a nossa vez!"},
  {"g3:0821eafd", "Uh...\\nOh, yes, I'm the MOVE DELETER.\\n\\nI can make POKéMON forget their moves.\\n\\nWould you like me to do that?", "Uh...\\nOh, sim, Sou o DELETA-GOLPES.\\n\\nEu posso fazer POKéMON esquecer\\nseus golpes.\\n\\nVocê quer meus serviços?"},
  {"g3:0821eb65", "Which POKéMON should forget a move?", "Qual PKMN deve esquecer o golpe?"},
  {"g3:0821eb89", "Which move should be forgotten?", "Qual golpe deve ser esquecido?"},
  {"g3:0821eba9", "{02} knows only one move\\nso it can't be forgotten...", "{02} knows only one move\\nso it can't be forgotten..."},
  {"g3:0821ebda", "Hm! {02}'s {03}?\\nThat move should be forgotten?", "Hm! {03} de {02}?\\nEsse golpe será esquecido?"},
  {"g3:0821ec06", "It worked to perfection!\\n\\n{02} has forgotten\\n{03} completely.", "Sim!\\nIsso foi perfeito!\\n\\n{02} esqueceu\\ncompletamente {03}."},
  {"g3:0821ec3f", "Come again if there are moves that\\nneed to be forgotten.", "Venha novamente se você precisar\\ndos meus serviços."},
  {"g3:0821ec78", "What?\\nNo EGG should know any moves.", "What?\\nNo EGG should know any moves."},
  {"g3:0821ec9c", "Hm!\\n\\nYour {02} doesn't seem willing\\nto forget SURF.", "Hm!\\n\\nSeu {02} parece nÃo querer   \\nesquecer SURFAR."},
  {"g3:0821ecea", "POKéMON are partners to people.\\nThey aren't our tools.\\n\\nUnfortunately, there are some people\\nwho fail to understand that...", "POKéMON sÃo parceiros das pessoas.\\nEles nÃo sÃo nossas ferramentas.\\n\\nInfelizmente, há algumas pessoas\\nque nÃo entende..."},
  {"g3:0821ed63", "KECLEON: Ruroro?", "KECLEON: Ruroro?"},
  {"g3:0821edb6", "Huh? What? What's that?\\n\\nI'm not near awake yet...\\nYou can have this...", "Eh? Que? Como?\\n\\nEu estava dormindo...\\nToma isso e me deixe descansar..."},
  {"g3:0821edf9", "Yawn...\\n\\nSleep is essential for good health...\\nSleep and regain health...", "Ei...?\\n\\nDormir é muito bom para a saúde...\\nO cérebro tem que descansar..."},
  {"g3:0821ef99", "Oh, my, my! Are you traveling alone?\\nBut you're so young! Good for you!\\n\\nI'm sure my kids could learn a thing\\nor two from you!\\n\\nMe? I'm a master of POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nIf I get serious just a little, why,\\nI can concoct great POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nWould you like to learn from me,\\na master of POKéBLOCKS?", "Oh! Você está viajando sozinho?\\nMas você é tÃo jovem! Bom para você!\\n\\nTenho certeza que meus filhos poderiam\\naprender uma coisa ou duas de você.\\n\\nEu? Sou mestre em POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nEu levo a sério só um pouco.\\nPosso inventar ótimas POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nEi... Quer aprender pela mestre\\ndas POKéBLOCKS?"},
  {"g3:0821f0a9", "Oh? Are you sure?\\n\\nYou shouldn't always try to do\\neverything by yourself, dear!", "Oh? Você tem certeza?\\n\\nVocê deveria sempre tentar fazer\\ntudo por você, fofura!"},
  {"g3:0821f0f8", "Oh, good! You're a smart soul!\\nThis is a bit long, so listen up!\\n\\nAre you ready?\\n\\nIf you look at POKéBLOCKS, you should see\\nthat they are rated on how they feel.\\n\\nThe lower the feel rating,\\nthe better it is. Don't forget this!\\n\\nA good POKéBLOCK has a low feel\\nrating and a high level.\\n\\nA POKéMON can eat more good\\nPOKéBLOCKS than ordinary ones, too.\\n\\nAnd this is important.\\n\\nIf you want to make smooth POKéBLOCKS,\\nuse different kinds of BERRIES.\\n\\nDon't be stingy--the kinds of BERRIES\\naffect the smoothness of POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nAnd another thing.\\n\\nThe more people blending BERRIES,\\nthe smoother the POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nThat's why you should talk to other\\npeople and make POKéBLOCKS together.\\n\\nThat's about all you need to know to\\nmake good POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nIf everyone had POKéMON they love,\\nsmooth POKéBLOCKS, and a loving family,\\n\\nthe world would be a happier place.\\n\\nDon't give up, dear!", "Ah, bom! Você é uma alma inteligente!\\nIsto é um pouco longo, por isso ouça.\\n\\nVocê tá pronto?\\n\\nVeja bem as POKéBLOCKS, voce deve ver que\\nelas sÃo classificadas pela sensaçÃo.\\n\\nA classificaçÃo da sensaçÃo mais baixa,\\né a melhor. NÃo esqueça disso!\\n\\nUma boa POKéBLOCK tem uma sensaçÃo bem\\nbaixa e um nÍvel elevado.\\n\\nUm POKéMON pode comer as melhores\\nPOKéBLOCKS e as comuns, também.\\n\\nE isso é importante.\\n\\nSe quiser fazer suave POKéBLOCKS,\\nuse diferentes tipos de frutos.\\n\\nNÃo seja mesquinho - tipos de FRUTOS\\nafetam a suavidade das POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nE outra coisa.\\n\\nSe muitas pessoas misturam FRUTOS,\\nmais suave fica uma POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nÉ por isso que você deve falar com outras\\npessoas e fazer POKéBLOCKS juntas.\\n\\nIsso é tudo que você precisa saber para\\nfazer ótimas POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nSe todos amam seus POKéMON crie suas,\\nPOKéBLOCKS, e faça o mundo melhor.\\n\\nEnfim...\\nNÃo desista nunca!"},
  {"g3:0821f430", "When my wife gave birth to quadruplets,\\nyou bet I was shocked.\\n\\nBut, now, seeing them play together,\\nit makes me happy.", "Quando minha esposa deu à luz\\nquadrigêmeos, eu fiquei chocado.\\n\\nMas, agora, vê-los jogar juntos,\\nisso me faz feliz."},
  {"g3:0821f4a7", "We're having MULTI BATTLES, but I know\\nI'm going to win.", "Estamos em uma MULTI BATTLES, mas eu sei\\nque vou ganhar."},
  {"g3:0821f4e0", "We like mixing stuff at\\nthe RECORD CORNER.\\n\\nBut what gets mixed up?", "Gostamos de misturar coisas\\nno RECORD CORNER.\\n\\nMas... misturar o que?"},
  {"g3:0821f523", "We're going to make super POKéBLOCKS\\nwith a BERRY BLENDER!", "Nós vamos fazer super POKéBLOCKS\\nsuaves lá no PROCESSADOR!"},
  {"g3:0821f55a", "I want to brag about how tough my\\nPOKéMON is, so we're going to enter\\n\\na CONTEST together.", "Eu quero dizer como é forte o meu\\nPOKéMON, por isso vamos entrar\\n\\nem um CONCURSO juntos."},
  {"g3:0821f5c7", "This planet's biggest mysteries are\\nat the bottom of the sea.\\n\\nSomebody said that, but I don't know...", "Maiores mistérios deste planeta estÃo\\nno fundo do mar.\\n\\nAlguém me disse isso...\\nMas eu nÃo sei quem..."},
  {"g3:0821f62b", "There's a deep underwater trench\\nbetween MOSSDEEP and SOOTOPOLIS.\\n\\nThat's what someone told me, anyway.", "Há uma vala profunda subaquática\\nentre MOSSDEEP e SOOTOPOLIS\\n\\nIsso que alguém me disse, vai acreditar..."},
  {"g3:0821f866", "Welcome to LILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE.", "Olá. Aqui é o CENTRO COMERCIAL."},
  {"g3:0821f88c", "Whenever I come to the DEPARTMENT\\nSTORE, I always end up buying all sorts\\n\\nof things because it's so fun.", "Sempre que venho ao CENTRO COMERCIAL,\\nsempre compro todos os tipos de coisas\\n\\nporque é muito divertido."},
  {"g3:0821f8f5", "Today, my mom is going to buy me some\\nnice furniture.", "Hoje, minha mÃe vai me comprar\\nalguns móveis legais."},
  {"g3:0821f92b", "I'm buying something for my AZUMARILL\\nas a reward for winning a CONTEST.", "Eu compro coisas para minha AZUMARILL,\\neu a agrado por vencer concurso."},
  {"g3:0821f974", "AZUMARILL: Maririroo!", "AZUMARILL: Maririroo!"},
  {"g3:0821f98a", "1F: SERVICE COUNTER\\n    LOTTERY CORNER\\n\\n2F: TRAINER'S ZONE\\n\\n3F: BATTLE COLLECTION\\n\\n4F: TM CORNER\\n\\n5F: POKé DOLL FLOOR\\n\\nROOFTOP: ROOFTOP PLAZA", "1F: SERVICE COUNTER\\n    LOTTERY CORNER\\n\\n2F: TRAINER'S ZONE\\n\\n3F: BATTLE COLLECTION\\n\\n4F: TM CORNER\\n\\n5F: POKé DOLL FLOOR\\n\\nROOFTOP: ROOFTOP PLAZA"},
  {"g3:0821fbac", "Learn to use items properly.\\nThat's basic, really.", "Aprenda a usar bem os itens.\\nIsso é básico mesmo."},
  {"g3:0821fbdf", "My husband is waiting at home.\\nWhat would make a good gift for him?", "Meu marido está esperando em casa.\\nQuero levar um bom presente?"},
  {"g3:0821fc23", "I'm leaving on a long journey soon.\\nI need to stock up on items.", "Vou fazer uma longa viagem em breve.\\nEu preciso estocar itens."},
  {"g3:0821fcd1", "For quickly toughening up POKéMON,\\nitems are the best.\\n\\nPROTEIN boosts ATTACK,\\nand CALCIUM raises SP. ATK.", "Para ajudar os POKéMON?\\nITENS sÃo os melhores.\\n\\nTipo...\\n\\nPROTEÍNA aumenta ATAQUE,\\ne CÁLCIO aumenta SP. ATQ."},
  {"g3:0821fd3b", "I want my POKéMON to have more\\nendurance.\\n\\nI'm trying to decide whether to raise\\nDEFENSE with IRON, or SP. DEF with ZINC.", "Eu quero que meus POKéMON tenha\\nmais resistência.\\n\\nEu tento me decidir entre...\\nDEFESA com FERRO, ou SP. DEF com ZINCO."},
  {"g3:0821fdb4", "I gave a CARBOS to my POKéMON,\\nand its SPEED went up.", "Aumentei a velocidade do meu\\nPOKéMON, com CARBURANTE."},
  {"g3:0821fe50", "Hmm...\\n\\nAn attacking move...\\nOr a defensive move...\\n\\nIt's no easy matter to decide which TM\\nmoves should be taught to POKéMON...", "Hmm...\\n\\nUm golpe de ataque...\\nOu um golpe defensivo...\\n\\nÉ nÃo é fácil decidir qual golpes TMs\\ndevem ser ensinados aos POKéMON..."},
  {"g3:0821fec7", "There are so many different kinds of\\nTM moves.\\n\\nA catalog I read said there are fifty\\ndifferent kinds.", "Existem tantos tipos diferentes\\nde golpes (TM).\\n\\nUm catálogo que li disse que há 50\\ntipos diferentes."},
  {"g3:0821ff2d", "I'd like to get all the different TMs,\\nbut a POKéMON learns only four moves.", "Eu gosto de ter (TM)s diferentes, mas\\num POKéMON aprende apenas 4 golpes."},
  {"g3:082200c5", "This place is full of cute DOLLS.\\n\\nI should buy some for me, instead of\\njust for my children.", "Este lugar está cheio\\nde BONECAS lindas.\\n\\nComprarei uma pra mim, e outras\\npara meus filhos."},
  {"g3:08220122", "I'm not big enough to raise POKéMON,\\nso I'm getting a cute DOLL instead.", "Eu nÃo consigo evoluir POKéMON, entÃo\\neu brinco com minhas bonecas."},
  {"g3:0822016b", "They sell many cute MATS here.\\n\\nI wonder which one I should get?\\nMaybe I'll buy them all...", "Vendem muitos TAPETES bonito aqui.\\n\\nNÃo sei qual eu devo ficar?\\nTalvez eu compre todos..."},
  {"g3:082201c4", "I think they closed the rooftop\\nbecause the weather is wild today.", "I think they closed the rooftop\\nbecause the weather is wild today."},
  {"g3:08220463", "Don't they have set dates for their\\nclear-out sales?\\n\\nI watch TV, but they never show any\\ncommercials.", "Eles nÃo definiram as datas para\\no dia de descontos?\\n\\nEu assisto TV, gosto de ver qualquer\\ncomercial."},
  {"g3:082204c9", "Yes! I've been waiting a long time for\\nthis clear-out sale.\\n\\nThey have items that you can only get\\nhere. I'm going to load up, that I am!", "Yes! I've been waiting a long time for\\nthis clear-out sale.\\n\\nThey have items that you can only get\\nhere. I'm going to load up, that I am!"},
  {"g3:08220552", "Ohh... I'm bone-dry thirsty!", "Ohh... Estou morto de sede!"},
  {"g3:0822056d", "It's a VENDING MACHINE.\\nWhich drink would you like?", "É uma MÁQUINA VENDEDORA.\\nNÃo sei se bebo algo..."},
  {"g3:082205a1", "Clang!\\n\\nA can of {02} dropped down.", "Clang!\\n\\nUma lata de {02} caiu aqui."},
  {"g3:082205c2", "Clang!\\n\\nScore! An extra can of {02}\\ndropped down!", "Clang!\\n\\nSorte! Uma lata extra\\nde {02} caiu aqui!"},
  {"g3:082205f1", "Not enough money...", "Not enough money..."},
  {"g3:08220603", "Decided against buying a drink.", "Melhor comprar bebidas depois..."},
  {"g3:08220cd5", "Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION-bound\\n{01}?\\n\\nThe GYM LEADERS here use\\nPSYCHIC-type POKéMON.\\n\\nIf you go up against them with\\nFIGHTING- or POISON-type POKéMON,\\n\\nthey'll inflict horrible damage!\\n\\nPlus, they'll come at you with\\noutstanding combination attacks.\\n\\nIf you want to win, you'll need to show\\nthem how tight you are with your\\n\\nPOKéMON. Go for it!", "Oi, como vai, {01}?\\nCaminho do CAMPEONATO?\\n\\nOs LÍDERES deste GINÁSIO usam\\nPOKéMON do tipo PSÍQUICO.\\n\\nSe atacar com POKéMON dos tipos\\nLUTADOR ou VENENO, vai receber\\n\\ndanos horrÍveis!\\n\\nAlém disso, vÃo combater com ataques\\ncombinados realmente incrÍveis.\\n\\nSe quer vencer, você precisa mostrar\\nque está muito unido com seus POKéMON.\\n\\nDesejo lhe sorte!"},
  {"g3:08220e2a", "Wow, you're astounding!\\nYou're one great TRAINER!", "Uau, você é surpreendente!\\nUm grande TREINADOR!"},
  {"g3:08220e5c", "Battles hinge on the strength of your\\nspirit! The weak-spirited will never win!", "O resultado do combate depende de sua\\nforça de vontade. EntÃo, nunca desista!"},
  {"g3:08220eac", "I lost!\\nI must temper my spirit again!", "Perdi...\\nTenho pouca força de vontade."},
  {"g3:08220ed3", "The indecisive lose.\\nThat's my warning to you.", "Tome cuidado...\\nEsse é o meu aviso para você."},
  {"g3:08220f02", "Let me see your talent!", "Quero ver seu talento!"},
  {"g3:08220f1a", "You possess spectacular talent!", "Uau...\\nSeu talento é espetacular!"},
  {"g3:08220f3a", "If there are prodigies in the world,\\nthen our GYM LEADERS are them!\\n\\nHowever, you may be even more talented\\nthan them...", "As maravilhas humanas deste mundo\\nsÃo os LÍDERES de GINÁSIO!\\n\\nNo entanto, você pode ter bem\\nmais talento do que eles..."},
  {"g3:08220fb0", "Fufufufu... Watch me levitate a POKé\\nBALL telekinetically!\\n\\nWrooooooooaaaar!\\n... ... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nSometimes, I'm out of sync...", "Ommmm... Veja como faço levitar\\numa POKé BOLA telepaticamente!\\n\\nAaaaaah!\\n\\nÀs vezes nÃo controlo muito\\nbem meus poderes."},
  {"g3:08221024", "My POKéMON battling skills are out\\nof sync, too!", "Meus POKéMON lutam, mas estÃo\\nfora de sincronia!"},
  {"g3:08221055", "A POKé BALL was too heavy to lift\\npsychically. But this dust bunny...\\n\\nWhoooooooooooooooh!\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nNo, I'm not cheating!\\nI didn't blow on it! Honestly!", "A POKé BOLA de antes pesava muito,\\nmas você verás com está pluma!\\n\\nOmmmmmm...\\n\\nO que?! NÃo! Isso nÃo é nenhum truque!\\nEu nÃo soprei, de verdade! Hehehehe."},
  {"g3:082210ee", "When you lose to me, don't be too hard\\non yourself.\\n\\nIt's not that you're weak--I'm just\\ntoo strong!", "Quando perder contra mim, nÃo culpe\\na si mesmo...\\n\\nNÃo é que você é fraco - e que EU\\nsou muito forte."},
  {"g3:08221152", "You're just too strong!", "Ai... Você é super forte..."},
  {"g3:0822116a", "I'm not going to get down on myself for\\nlosing. I just need to train harder.\\n\\nPositive thinking--that's my strong\\npoint!", "Eu nÃo vou ficar me culpando por perder.\\nEu só preciso treinar mais.\\n\\nO pensamento positivo - isso é o meu\\nponto forte!"},
  {"g3:082211e2", "I see it...\\nI see your future...\\n\\nIf you can beat me, I will tell you\\nyour future!", "Eu vejo...\\nEu vejo o seu futuro...\\n\\nSe você ganhar, eu vou lhe dizer\\no seu futuro!"},
  {"g3:08221230", "I surrender!", "Eu me rendo!"},
  {"g3:0822123d", "You will wage a terrifically intense\\nbattle with our GYM LEADERS...\\n\\nThe result...\\nYou won't hear it from me!", "Posso ver que terá uma intensa\\nbatalha com nossos LÍDERES...\\n\\nO resultado...\\nIsso você nÃo vai ouvir de mim!"},
  {"g3:082212a6", "The roads you have traveled...\\nWhat you have experienced...\\n\\nCome at me with everything you've\\nlearned!", "Tem viajado muito e tem vivido\\ntodo tipo de experiências...\\n\\nEnsina-me agora tudo o que\\njá aprendeu!"},
  {"g3:08221309", "You've traveled a path of greatness!", "Você andou pelo caminho\\nda grandeza!"},
  {"g3:0822132e", "A bright future awaits those who have\\nworked diligently.\\n\\nFor those who lazed idly, there is\\nonly despair at the end.\\n\\nWhat goes around comes around...", "A aqueles que trabalham duro\\nos aguarda um futuro brilhante.\\n\\nA aqueles que sÃo preguiçosos\\nhá apenas desespero no final.\\n\\nO que vai, sempre volta..."},
  {"g3:082213c2", "Even at the risk of life, I will win\\nthis battle!", "Penso em ganhar este combate\\ncuste o que custar!"},
  {"g3:082213f4", "What you do...\\nIt horrifies me...", "O que você fez...\\né assustador..."},
  {"g3:08221412", "How dare you beat me...\\n\\nIt won't be my fault if something\\nhorrible befalls you...", "Como se atreve a me derrotar...\\n\\nNÃo será culpa minha se algo\\nhorrÍvel te pegar..."},
  {"g3:08221460", "Hohoho.\\n\\nYou need me to show you how tenacious\\nthe PSYCHIC type can be.", "Hehehe...\\n\\nSerá um prazer em mostrar como\\ntenaz pode ser o tipo PSÍQUICO."},
  {"g3:082214a7", "Oh! My, my!\\nYour battle style is fantastic!", "Fantástico!\\nQue estilo de luta magnÍfico!"},
  {"g3:082214d3", "I... I don't let defeat rattle m-me,\\nhowever b-badly.", "Eu nÃo deixo a derrota me desanimar,\\nporém é chato."},
  {"g3:08221507", "Let me show you a perfectly awful,\\nhorrifying time!", "Heheheheh... Deixe-me mostrar como\\né ficar em pânico!"},
  {"g3:0822153b", "N-nooooo!", "NÃooooo!"},
  {"g3:08221545", "Your vitality is contagious!\\nGet away from me quickly!", "Sua vitalidade é contagiante!\\nSai perto de mim rápido!"},
  {"g3:0822157c", "I may be past my prime, but I suggest\\nyou not patronize me.", "Eu tenho um passado nobre, mas eu sugiro\\nnÃo faça truques."},
  {"g3:082215b8", "Ah, you overflow with the power\\nof youth!", "Ah, esta juventude!\\nUm estouro de poder!"},
  {"g3:082215e2", "It seems that I could not overcome\\nyour youthful energy.", "Parece que eu nÃo poderia superar\\nsua energia juvenil."},
  {"g3:0822161b", "You're not getting through to the end!\\nNot if I can help it!", "Hehehe...\\nVocê nÃo vai chegar ao fim!\\n\\nNÃo se eu puder impedir!"},
  {"g3:08221658", "How could you be so ludicrously\\nstrong?", "Como você é tÃo ridiculamente\\nforte?"},
  {"g3:08221680", "Humph! You may be strong, but you're\\nnot suitable for the PSYCHIC type!\\n\\nThe way you battle is somehow brutal!", "Uma ova! Você pode ser forte, mas nÃo\\ntem qualidades para o tipo PSÍQUICO!\\n\\nSua maneira de batalhar é brutal!"},
  {"g3:082216ee", "Wroooar! Have a taste of my super\\nPOKéMON hard-battling power!", "Grrrrr! Prove a derrota pelo meu\\nsuper POKéMON! Prepare-se!"},
  {"g3:0822172d", "Oh!\\nDone in!", "Oh!\\nAcabou?!"},
  {"g3:0822173a", "All right! I think I'll develop a special\\ninvincible POKéMON power next.", "Ok! Na próxima vez eu vou desenvolver\\num POKéMON com poder invencÍvel."},
  {"g3:08221783", "TATE: Hehehe... Were you surprised?\\n\\nLIZA: Fufufu... Were you surprised?\\n\\nTATE: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\\nLIZA: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\\n\\nTATE: We're twins!\\nLIZA: We're twins!\\n\\nTATE: We don't need to talk because...\\nLIZA: We can each determine what...\\n\\nTATE: The other is thinking...\\nLIZA: All in our minds!\\n\\nTATE: This combination of ours...\\nLIZA: Can you beat it?", "TATE: Hehe... NÃo te esperava aqui?\\n\\nLIZA: Fufu... Você me surpreendeu?\\n\\nTATE: Somos 2 LÍDERES de GINÁSIOS!\\nLIZA: Somos 2 LÍDERES de GINÁSIOS!\\n\\nTATE: Somos gêmeas!\\nLIZA: Somos gêmeas!\\n\\nTATE: NÃo precisamos falar porque...\\nLIZA: nós duas sempre sabemos o que...\\n\\nTATE: a outra está pensando...\\nLIZA: É telepatia!\\n\\nTATE: Nossa combinaçÃo juntas...\\nLIZA: somos invencÍveis?"},
  {"g3:082218ec", "TATE: What?! Our combination...\\nLIZA: Was shattered!\\n\\nTATE: It can't be helped. You've won...\\nLIZA: So, in recognition, take this.", "TATE: O quê?! Nossa combinaçÃo...\\nLIZA: foi abalada!\\n\\nTATE: A vida é assim. Você ganhou...\\nLIZA: Em reconhecimento, leve isso."},
  {"g3:0822196a", "{01} received the MIND BADGE\\nfrom TATE and LIZA.", "{01} ganhou «INSÍGNIA MENTE»\\nde TATE & LIZA."},
  {"g3:08221999", "TATE: The MIND BADGE enhances the\\nSP. ATK and SP. DEF of POKéMON.\\n\\nLIZA: It also lets you use the HM move\\nDIVE outside of battle.\\n\\nTATE: You should also take this, too.", "TATE: A «INSÍGNIA MENTE» melhora o\\nSP. ATQ e SP. DEF dos POKéMON.\\n\\nLIZA: Também permite que você use o\\n(HM) MERGULHO fora da batalha.\\n\\nTATE: Toma, leve isso também..."},
  {"g3:08221a40", "TATE: That TM04 contains...\\nLIZA: CALM MIND!\\n\\nTATE: It raises SP. ATK and...\\nLIZA: It raises SP. DEF!\\n\\nTATE: It's a move that's perfect...\\nLIZA: For PSYCHIC POKéMON!\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...", "TATE: Esse TM04 contém...\\nLIZA: MENTE CALMA!\\n\\nTATE: Aumenta SP. ATQ e...\\nLIZA: Aumenta SP. DEF!\\n\\nTATE: É um golpe que é perfeito...\\nLIZA: para POKéMON PSÍQUICOS!\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ... ..."},
  {"g3:08221aea", "Registered GYM LEADERS TATE & LIZA\\nin the POKéNAV.", "Registrou LÍDER DO GYM TATE & LIZA    \\nna POKéNAV!"},
  {"g3:08221b1d", "TATE: Looks like the bond between you\\nand your POKéMON is far stronger than\\n\\nthe bond that we share as twins.\\n\\nLIZA: You will become even stronger!\\nWe've battled you, so we know.", "TATE: Parece que o vÍnculo que te une\\na seus POKéMON é mais forte que\\n\\no que nos une como gêmeas.\\n\\nLIZA: E te fará ser ainda mais forte!\\nLutamos contra você, por isso sabemos."},
  {"g3:08221bce", "TATE: Hehehe... Were you surprised?\\n\\nLIZA: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\\n\\nTATE: Oops, you have only one...\\nLIZA: POKéMON that can battle.\\n\\nTATE: We can't battle that way!\\n\\nLIZA: If you want to challenge us,\\nbring some more POKéMON.", "TATE: Hehehe... Were you surprised?\\n\\nLIZA: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\\n\\nTATE: Oops, you have only one...\\nLIZA: POKéMON that can battle.\\n\\nTATE: We can't battle that way!\\n\\nLIZA: If you want to challenge us,\\nbring some more POKéMON."},
  {"g3:08221cb0", "MOSSDEEP CITY POKéMON GYM", "MOSSDEEP GINÁSIO POKéMON"},
  {"g3:08221cca", "MOSSDEEP CITY POKéMON GYM\\n\\nLIZA AND TATE'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\\n{01}", "MOSSDEEP GINÁSIO POKéMON\\n\\nLIZA & TATE CERTIFICOU TREINADOR:\\n{01}"},
  {"g3:08221d0b", "TATE: POKéMON...\\nLIZA: POKéMON...\\n\\nTATE: By changing the party's mix...\\nLIZA: The battle style changes.\\n\\nTATE: But me...\\nLIZA: But me...\\n\\nTATE: I'll always be with LIZA!\\nLIZA: I'll always be with TATE!\\n\\nTATE: Our combination...\\nLIZA: We'll show you again and again!", "TATE: POKéMON...\\nLIZA: POKéMON...\\n\\nTATE: Mudanças em nossa equipe...\\nLIZA: Mudando o estilo de batalhar.\\n\\nTATE: Mas eu...\\nLIZA: E eu também...\\n\\nTATE: Sempre estarei com LIZA!\\nLIZA: Sempre estarei com TATE!\\n\\nTATE: Nossa combinaçÃo...\\nLIZA: Te mostrarei mais uma vez!"},
  {"g3:08221e05", "TATE: You and your POKéMON...\\nLIZA: It's as if you were siblings!", "TATE: Você e seus POKéMON...\\nLIZA:  É como se fossem irmÃos!"},
  {"g3:08221e45", "TATE: You can knock us down,\\nbut we'll never stay down!\\n\\nLIZA: Because the two of us,\\nwe always support each other!", "TATE: Você pode nos derrubar,\\nmas nunca ficaremos triste!\\n\\nLIZA: Porque nós duas,\\nsempre apoiamos uma na outra!"},
  {"g3:08221eb8", "TATE: You're back again...\\nLIZA: You're back again...\\n\\nTATE: To give us a rematch.\\nLIZA: To give us a rematch.\\n\\nTATE: But...\\nLIZA: For our match...\\n\\nTATE: You brought just one POKéMON!\\nLIZA: You brought just one POKéMON!\\n\\nTATE: We need you to bring at least...\\nLIZA: Two POKéMON when you come back.", "TATE: You're back again...\\nLIZA: You're back again...\\n\\nTATE: To give us a rematch.\\nLIZA: To give us a rematch.\\n\\nTATE: But...\\nLIZA: For our match...\\n\\nTATE: You brought just one POKéMON!\\nLIZA: You brought just one POKéMON!\\n\\nTATE: We need you to bring at least...\\nLIZA: Two POKéMON when you come back."},
  {"g3:0822200f", "Hmm!\\nYour {02}...", "Hmm!\\nSeu {02}..."},
  {"g3:0822201d", "It likes {02}S,\\ndoesn't it?\\n\\nNo, I'm positive of it! It definitely\\nlikes {02}S!", "O que mais gosta é uma\\n{02}, acho?\\n\\nSim, sim, nÃo tenho dúvida.\\nAdora as {02}!"},
  {"g3:08222068", "It doesn't appear to like or dislike\\nany POKéBLOCKS.", "Hm... Parece que nÃo tem nehuma\\nPOKéBLOCK favorita."},
  {"g3:08222099", "My husband can tell what kind of\\nPOKéBLOCKS a POKéMON likes at a glance.", "Meu marido pode dizer que tipo de\\nPOKéBLOCKS um POKéMON gosta."},
  {"g3:08222146", "My little sister exchanges MAIL with\\nher boyfriend in FORTREE.\\n\\nI don't envy her one bit at all.", "Minha irmÃ mais nova troca CARTAS\\ncom seu namorado de FORTREE.\\n\\nOh... Eu nÃo invejo nem um pouco."},
  {"g3:082221a6", "Even though I can't see my friend in\\nFORTREE, my POKéMON carries MAIL\\n\\nback and forth for us.\\n\\nI'm not lonesome, even though we're\\napart.", "NÃo posso ver meu namorado que vive\\nem FORTREE, e meu POKéMON leva\\n\\ne trás nossas CARTAS.\\n\\nAssim podemos ter contato\\nmesmo a distância."},
  {"g3:0822222e", "WINGULL: Pihyoh!", "WINGULL: Pihyoh!"},
  {"g3:0822226e", "The GYM LEADERS in this town are\\na formidable duo.\\n\\nTheir combination attacks are, like,\\nexcellent and wow!", "Os LÍDERES de GINÁSIO desta cidade\\nforma uma dupla formidável.\\n\\nSeus ataques e combinaçöes sÃo...\\nExcelentes!"},
  {"g3:082222d9", "Depending on the special abilities of\\nPOKéMON, some moves might change\\n\\nor not work at all.", "As vezes as HABILIDADES ESPECIAIS\\ndos POKéMON, alguns golpes podem\\n\\nmudar ou nÃo funcionar."},
  {"g3:08222364", "If I win a whole lot of link battles\\nand show everyone how good I am,\\n\\nI might get a fan following!", "Se eu ganhar um monte de batalhas links\\ne mostrar a todos o quÃo bom eu sou,\\n\\nEu poderia ter fÃs!"},
  {"g3:08222411", "REVIVE is fantastic!\\n\\nGive it to a fainted POKéMON,\\nand the POKéMON will arise.\\n\\nBut be careful, REVIVE doesn't restore\\nthe used-up PP of moves.", "REVIVER é fantástico!\\n\\nSe dá a um POKéMON desmaiado,\\nse recupera e pode lutar de novo.\\n\\nMas cuidado: REVIVER nÃo restaura\\no PP usado nos golpes."},
  {"g3:082224a0", "MAX REPEL keeps all weak POKéMON away.\\n\\nOut of all the REPEL sprays, it lasts\\nthe longest.", "MÁX. REPEL mantém afastado todos\\nos POKéMON fracos.\\n\\nÉ o melhor REPELENTE,\\nesse dura mais."},
  {"g3:082224fa", "The NET and DIVE BALLS are rare POKé\\nBALLS that are only made in MOSSDEEP.\\n\\nA NET BALL is effective against\\nBUG-type and WATER-type POKéMON.\\n\\nA DIVE BALL works best on POKéMON\\nat the bottom of the sea.", "A BOLA REDE e DIVE BOLA sÃo umas\\nPOKé BOLAS próprias de MOSSDEEP.\\n\\nA BOLA REDE é eficaz com os POKéMON\\ndo tipo - INSETO e ÁQUA.\\n\\nA DIVE BOLA funciona melhor com os\\nPOKéMON que vivem no fundo do mar."},
  {"g3:08222616", "Hey there, TRAINER!\\nA SUPER ROD really is super!\\n\\nSay all you want, but this baby can\\ncatch POKéMON off the seafloor!\\n\\nWhat do you think?\\nYou want it, don't you?", "Ei, você, uma SUPER VARA é a melhor\\npara qualquer TREINADOR!\\n\\nNÃo concorda? Pois é a melhor para\\npescar POKéMON marinhos.\\n\\nO que acha?\\nVocê quer ter uma, nÃo é?"},
  {"g3:082226b6", "You bet, you bet!\\nAfter all, a SUPER ROD is really super!", "Sim, eu sabia!\\n\\nAfinal, um SUPER VARA é realmente super!"},
  {"g3:082226f0", "If there's any water, try dropping in\\nyour ROD and see what bites!", "Se ver alguma água, tente jogar\\na tua vara e veja o que morde!"},
  {"g3:08222733", "Hunh?\\nDon't you like to fish?", "... ...\\n\\nQuê?\\nNÃo gosta de pescar?"},
  {"g3:08222751", "Go after the seafloor POKéMON with\\nyour SUPER ROD.", "Pesque POKéMON marinhos\\ncom ajuda da SUPER VARA."},
  {"g3:08222936", "STEVEN: {01}{05}...\\n\\nAs you can see, there's not much here,\\nbut this is my home.\\n\\nThank you for all that you've done.\\n\\nThis is my token of appreciation.\\nIt's the HIDDEN MACHINE DIVE.\\n\\nNo need to be shy--you've earned\\nthis HM.", "STEVEN: {01}{05}...\\n\\nComo você pode ver, nÃo há muito aqui,\\nmas esta é a minha casa.\\n\\nObrigado por tudo que você fez.\\n\\nEste é o meu sinal de gratidÃo.\\nÉ um (HM) chamado MERGULHO.\\n\\nAceite por favor...\\nnÃo precisa ter vegonha."},
  {"g3:08222a0e", "STEVEN: While you're using SURF, you\\nshould notice dark patches of water.\\n\\nUse DIVE if you come to deep water\\nlike it. You'll drop to the seafloor.\\n\\nWhen you want to come back up, use\\nDIVE again.\\n\\nIn some places, it won't be possible\\nfor you to surface, though.", "STEVEN: Quando estar usando SURFAR,\\ndeve notar manchas escuras na água.\\n\\nNesses lugares pode usar MERGULHO.\\nAssim chegará até o fundo do mar.\\n\\nQuando quiser voltar a superfÍcie,\\nvolte a usar MERGULHO.\\n\\nHá locais, que nÃo será possÍvel\\nvoltar para a superfÍcie."},
  {"g3:08222b11", "STEVEN: Apparently, there's an\\nunderwater cavern between\\n\\nMOSSDEEP and SOOTOPOLIS.\\n\\nYou know, the one that CAPT. STERN\\nfound in his submarine.", "STEVEN: Parece que há uma caverna\\nsubaquática entre MOSSDEEP e\\n\\nSOOTOPOLIS.\\n\\nSim, já sabe, quem a descobriu foi\\nCAPT. STERN com seu submarino."},
  {"g3:08222b9e", "{01} checked the POKé BALL.\\n\\nIt contained the POKéMON\\nBELDUM.\\n\\nTake the POKé BALL?", "{01} verifica a POKé BOLA.\\n\\nEla contém o POKéMON\\nBELDUM.\\n\\nQuer pegar a POKé BOLA?"},
  {"g3:08222bed", "{01} obtained a BELDUM.", "{01} obteve um BELDUM."},
  {"g3:08222c2a", "{01} left the POKé BALL where\\nit was.", "{01} deixou a POKé BOLA\\nno seu lugar."},
  {"g3:08222c4e", "It's a letter.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nTo {01}{05}...\\n\\nI've decided to do a little soul-\\nsearching and train on the road.\\n\\nI don't plan to return home for some\\ntime.\\n\\nI have a favor to ask of you.\\n\\nI want you to take the POKé BALL on\\nthe desk.\\n\\nInside it is a BELDUM, my favorite\\nPOKéMON.\\n\\nI'm counting on you.\\n\\nMay our paths cross someday.\\n\\nSTEVEN STONE", "É uma carta.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nPara {01}{05}...\\n\\nDecidi seguir a minha alma\\ne buscar um rumo.\\n\\nNÃo planejo voltar para casa\\npor bastante tempo.\\n\\nPor isso devo pedir um favor.\\n\\nQuero que você leve a POKéBOLA\\nque está na mesa.\\n\\nDentro há um BELDUM,\\nmeu POKéMON favorito.\\n\\nConto com você.\\n\\nEspero que nossos caminhos\\nse cruzem algum dia.\\n\\nSTEVEN STONE"},
  {"g3:08222d97", "It's a collection of rare rocks and\\nstones assembled by STEVEN.", "É uma bela coleçÃo de rochas e pedras\\nraras reunida por STEVEN."},
  {"g3:08222e31", "My little brother says he likes to go\\nfind people's SECRET BASES.", "Meu irmÃo diz que gosta de encontrar\\nBASES SECRETAS das pessoas."},
  {"g3:08222e73", "My little brother says he likes to\\nvisit people's SECRET BASES and have\\n\\nPOKéMON battles.", "Meu irmÃo diz que gosta de ir nas\\nBASES SECRETAS das pessoas\\n\\npara ter batalhas POKéMON."},
  {"g3:08222ecc", "Was it you who made a SECRET BASE\\nnear {02}?", "Foi você que fez uma BASE SECRETA\\nna {02}?"},
  {"g3:08222ef7", "You should make a SECRET BASE\\nsomewhere. I'll go find it!", "Faça uma BASE SECRETA em algum lugar.\\nAÍ, eu te encontro!"},
  {"g3:08222f31", "SKITTY: Miyaan?", "SKITTY: Miyaan?"},
  {"g3:082232a7", "The rocket's launch is imminent!", "O lançamento do foguete é tudo!"},
  {"g3:082232c8", "The rocket launched safely!\\nThat's successful launch no. {02}!", "Foguete lançado com segurança!\\nEsse foi o lançamento Nº. {02}!"},
  {"g3:08223305", "I know that things are a little\\nhaywire right now, but...\\n\\nThe rocket's launch is imminent!", "Eu sei que as coisas estÃo\\num pouco ruim agora, mas...\\n\\no lançamento do foguete é iminente!"},
  {"g3:0822335e", "I know that things are a little\\nhaywire right now, but...\\n\\nThe rocket launched safely!\\nThat's successful launch no. {02}!", "Eu sei que as coisas estÃo\\num pouco ruim agora, mas...\\n\\nFoguetes lançados com segurança...\\njá foi o lançamento de Nº. {02}!"},
  {"g3:082233d3", "A rocket launch demands perfection.\\nNot even a 1% margin of error is allowed.\\n\\nEven if it's 99% okay, the whole thing\\nis useless if 1% happens to be no good.\\n\\nDespite that, we never stop trying.\\nWhy? It's a dream that never ends.", "Lançar um foguete exige muita perfeiçÃo.\\nA margem de 1% de erro nÃo é permitido.\\n\\nMesmo que seja 99% tudo bem,\\ntorna-se tudo inútil se 1% falha.\\n\\nApesar disso, nós seguimos tentando.\\nPor quê? Porque é nosso sonho."},
  {"g3:082234b7", "Those MAGMA thugs have their sights\\nset on our SPACE CENTER.\\n\\nBut we can't allow anything that minor\\nto interfere with our rocket launch!", "Esses bandidos da EQUIPE MAGMA\\nplanejam algo no CENTRO ESPACIAL.\\n\\nMas nÃo podemos deixar isso interfirir\\ncom o lançamento do foguete!"},
  {"g3:08223540", "I was taking a stroll down the beach\\nwhen I found this.\\n\\nIt's not anything I need, so you can\\nhave it.", "Eu estava dando uma volta pela\\npraia quando encontrei isso.\\n\\nEu nÃo preciso, entÃo eu posso\\nte dá-lo."},
  {"g3:082235a6", "The HOENN region has been famous for \\nits meteor showers for a long time.", "A regiÃo HOENN ficou famosa por suas\\nchuvas de meteoritos há muito tempo."},
  {"g3:082235f0", "TEAM MAGMA can't be allowed to steal\\nthe rocket fuel.\\n\\nOh, by the way, you can have this stone\\nI found on the beach.", "NÃo podemos permitir que a EQUIPE\\nMAGMA roube o combustÍvel.\\n\\nVeja, eu encontrei está pedra\\nlá na praia. Pode levar."},
  {"g3:08223664", "With TEAM MAGMA around, I guess\\nstrolls on the beach aren't safe.", "Com a EQUIPE MAGMA aqui, acho que\\nnÃo é seguro passear na praia."},
  {"g3:082236a6", "Some people claim that POKéMON came\\nfrom space. Could it be true?", "Algumas pessoas afirmam que POKéMON\\nveio do espaço. Será verdade?"},
  {"g3:082236e8", "TEAM AQUA should take care of\\nTEAM MAGMA!\\n\\nBut if they did that, TEAM AQUA will\\nbecome bold and brazen, won't they?", "A EQUIPE AQUA deveria dar\\no que merece a EQUIPE MAGMA!\\n\\nMas, se fazem isso, a EQUIPE AQUA\\ntornar-se ousada, nÃo é?"},
  {"g3:0822375b", "A giant chunk of metal bursts through\\nthe skies and flies into space...\\n\\nIt boggles my mind!", "Um enorme pedaço de metal que pode\\nsair voando para o espaço...\\n\\nIsso confunde minha mente...!"},
  {"g3:082237b5", "A giant chunk of metal bursts through\\nthe skies and flies into space...\\n\\nBut TEAM MAGMA wants to spoil\\nthat dream of mine!\\n\\nI'm not having any of that!", "Um enorme pedaço de metal que pode\\nsair voando para o espaço...\\n\\nMas a EQUIPE MAGMA quer\\ndestruir esse grande sonho!\\n\\nNÃoooo...\\nEu nÃo posso permitir!"},
  {"g3:08223849", "STEVEN: {01}{05}, have you read that\\nproclamation already?\\n\\nTEAM MAGMA is coming after the rocket\\nfuel on this island.\\n\\nI don't know what they'd need it for,\\nbut they can't be allowed to take it.\\n\\nI'll keep an eye on things for\\na while longer.\\n\\nIn the meantime, why don't you go\\ncheck out the town?", "STEVEN: {01}{05}, já está\\nsabendo da notÍcia?\\n\\nA EQUIPE MAGMA quer fazer algo\\ncom o combustÍvel de foguete.\\n\\nEu nÃo tenho nem idéia de para que,\\no querem, mas nÃo podem levá-lo.\\n\\nVou ficar de olho nas coisas por\\naqui um pouco mais.\\n\\nEnquanto isso, por que você nÃo\\nvai dar umas voltas pela cidade?"},
  {"g3:0822396c", "As promised, we've come for\\nthe rocket fuel!", "Como prometido.\\nViemos pegar o combustÍvel!"},
  {"g3:08223999", "Ran out of fuel...", "Sem combustÍvel..."},
  {"g3:082239aa", "Don't think you're on a roll just\\nbecause you've beaten me!", "NÃo pense que você está seguro\\nsó porque você me venceu!"},
  {"g3:082239e6", "We gave you fair warning!\\nThere's nothing sneaky about us!", "Hehe... Nós te damos um aviso!\\nNÃo há nada de estranho aqui!"},
  {"g3:08223a21", "Grrr...\\nWe should've used sneaky treachery...", "Grrrrr...\\nDeverÍa ter usado alguns truques..."},
}
